      "title": "P104: four stay drops on #7608 (mains 185, 82 at F1062; main 46 at F914+F245), conditional kappa 0.00365242381187 (CLEAR-content premise)",
      "head": "bbdbc8aea2f4fd94a927f6d8c438372c0c69ae6c",
      "state": "open",
      "body": "## Result\n\nConditional κ = **0.00365242381186666478…**, ×1.0003978 (+0.03978%) over #7610 (κ 0.00365097153936). This word contains #7610's main-46 drop at the 245 stay and supersedes it. Base: the word of #7608 (vendored in `data/`), which is aliromman's #7605 with one edit, on FanPUYen's #7604, SYLforge's #7603, ToikY's #7546 and our #7601.\n\nFour non-owned stays are dropped: mains 185 and 82 at chart 1062, and main 46 at charts 914 and 245 (main 46 now goes 513→127 directly). One joint exact repair (5 corrections) and 40 premix ops at chart 3 (frame {0}; 38 ADDs and 2 SCALEs) keep all 1,569 rows, end charts, owned MOVEs, lifetimes (74), peak (50), header, caller data and grid equal #7608's. Three new public chart pairs, each a strictly nested ascent: (401,922) 2→7, (513,127) 3→9, (740,1071) 3→6. Native paid delta is {1:−3, 2:−2, 4:−1, 5:+1, 6:+1}, charged 17 times; paid positions are 110,349 → 110,281 with S = 1,424.\n\n## Official tools\n\n- `compare_recursive_invoices.py` #7608 → new: `uniformly_better`, strictly negative for r^(1−C), paid {1:−51, 2:−34, 4:−17, 5:+17, 6:+17}, targets unchanged.\n- `evaluate_recursive_power.py` (256 bits): `new_cost_lower` at C = 0.0036524238118 (and at #7610's 0.0036509715393 and #7608's 0.003650749565983); `new_cost_higher` at C = 0.0036524238119.\n- `scripts/research_package.py --package research/p104-four-stay-drops`: PASS (`check.py` and `price.py` included).\n\n## Premise: CONDITIONAL\n\nThis word inherits #7608's CLEAR #44 content premise and adds none: CLEAR #44 (owned 1557) erases `{451:−1, 1495:1}`, and all 74 CLEARs erase exactly #7608's content (checked by `check.py`). If #7608's premise is refused, this word is void with #7608 (and #7610).\n\nNot rerun: signed #7113 caller, outer predicates, precision/tape. Header, rows, grid and owned data are unchanged. An independent read-only audit found the word sound relative to #7608; no upstream maintainer has reviewed it.\n\nCredit: DreamingOfClouds with Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), via Claude Code. Builds on #7610, #7608 and aliromman's #7605.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
